:{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.1990509033203,38.66194534301758]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"長沼","category":"nature","address":"湖沼景観 / 湖沼","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"06365","municipality_pref":"山形県","municipality_name":"大蔵村","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"701"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.22100830078125,38.62633514404297]}}],"display_comment_original":"大蔵村周辺には、近世村の記憶として清水町村、赤松村、南山村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には史跡や遺跡、城跡や陣屋跡に関わる場所が見え、清水城跡、上竹野遺跡、白須賀遺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、清水町村、赤松村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板を、既存ピンと照らして歩くと発見しやすい。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":[],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["清水城跡","肘折温泉（国民保養温泉地）","湯座神社","地蔵倉","日本の棚田百選「四ヶ村」","全日本ラングラウフ月山大蔵大会","日本オリンピック委員会","湯の台観光ラベンダー園"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E8%94%B5%E6%9D%91"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"大蔵村","wikipedia_revision_id":"109748837","wikidata_qid":"Q1347371","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E8%94%B5%E6%9D%91","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}